# Rows "<job>\t<seconds>" of successful CI jobs -> docs/assessment/ci.md (make ci-durations).
split("\n")
| map(select(length > 0) | split("\t") | {job: .[0], seconds: (.[1] | tonumber)})
| group_by(.job)
| map({job: .[0].job, runs: length, sorted: (map(.seconds) | sort)})
| map(. + {median: .sorted[(.runs / 2 | floor)], longest: .sorted[-1]})
| def minutes: . / 60 * 10 | round / 10 | tostring + " min";
  "<!-- Generated by `make ci-durations` from the GitHub Actions API; do not edit. -->\n\n"
  + "# CI durations\n\n"
  + "Successful jobs of the last \($runs) green runs of `ci.yml`. "
  + "`checks` and `infra` run on every push; `dev` deploys to Databricks Free Edition and runs one business "
  + "date; `prod` deploys to Azure, or destroys the bundle there, on demand.\n\n"
  + "| Job | Runs | Median | Longest |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n"
  + (map("| `\(.job)` | \(.runs) | \(.median | minutes) | \(.longest | minutes) |") | join("\n"))
  + "\n"
